{"3524180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "终曲。", "steam_appid": 3524180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4324170, 4333990], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏说明</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《终曲。》是由青空社AozoraSoftware开发的视觉小说游戏，游戏通过点击鼠标来进行故事推动，以便更加沉浸的体验故事。故事以音乐为主题，讲述了一个被摇滚所救赎的故事。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏介绍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524180/extras/6ba2c2d8322e1c0f610a81593da8f579.avif?t=1768543403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524180/extras_big/6ba2c2d8322e1c0f610a81593da8f579.avif?t=1768543403 width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“对你来说，音乐是什么？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在我的眼中，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >音乐是一把钥匙，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一把可以打开人心的钥匙</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >人们总是要向许许多多的事情妥协，将自己的情感，自己的心套上一把锁</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >音乐就是这把锁的钥匙</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >它能够解开枷锁</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >悲伤也好，愤怒也好，欢乐也好</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无论什么样的感情，无论什么样的话语，都可以编织成歌曲</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >有了这把钥匙，我们，还有大家……至少在尾奏结束之前，可以暂时摘下那副沉重的镣铐了吧……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524180/extras/f45a0c56b3415cd87eb11750c961f5b2.avif?t=1768543403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524180/extras_big/f45a0c56b3415cd87eb11750c961f5b2.avif?t=1768543403 width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524180/extras/15710590d01da9be738d58602395541a.avif?t=1768543403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524180/extras_big/15710590d01da9be738d58602395541a.avif?t